OL,3,AJudge blocks construction of Trump's
OL,4,Amassive arch after federal agency
OL,5,Aapproval
OL,6,
OL,7,FA federal judge has temporarily blocked
OL,8,Fconstruction of US President Donald
OL,9,FTrump's "triumphal arch" in the
OL,10,Fnation's capital.
OL,12,FUS District Judge Tanya Chutkan ruled
OL,13,Fthat there should be a 14-day pause
OL,14,Fbefore any work can start on the arch
OL,15,Fin Washington which the Trump
OL,16,Fadministration had said could begin
OL,17,Fthis week.
OL,19,FEarlier on Thursday the National
OL,20,FCapital Planning Commission (NCPC)
OL,21,Fvoted 8-4 to allow construction of the
OL,22,Fplanned 250ft (72m) arch.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
