OL,3,AJudge blocks construction of Trump's
OL,4,Amassive arch after federal agency
OL,5,Aapproval
OL,6,
OL,7,FTrump appointees on the board said the
OL,8,Farch would be a fitting tribute to US
OL,9,Fhistory and to veterans but opponents
OL,10,Fhave argued it would block the view of
OL,11,FArlington National Cemetery, the
OL,12,Fresting place of thousands of US
OL,13,Fsoldiers and service people.
